  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Drain and rinse black beans. Drain sweetcorn. Finely chop brown onion.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook black beans, onion and corn, stirring, until tender, 2-3 minutes. Lightly mash black bean mixture with a potato masher or fork.\n• SPICY! This spice blend is hot! Add less if you're sensitive to heat. Add Mexican Fiesta spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in the water, butter and baby spinach leaves, until wilted and combined, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-668d1c01c2d484eb98289ec7-ab1213d1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Arrange mini flourtortillas over a lined oven tray. Divide bean mixture among tortillas, spooning it onto one half of each tortilla, then top with Cheddar cheese.\n• Fold empty half of each tortilla over to enclose filling and press down with spatula. Brush or spray tortillas with a drizzle of olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Bake quesadillas until cheese has melted and tortillas are golden, 8-10 minutes. Spoon any overflowing filling and cheese back into quesadillas. TIP: Place a sheet of baking paper and a second oven tray on top of the quesadillas if they unfold during cooking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-668d1c01c2d484eb98289ec7-964120f8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop tomato and coriander.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tomato, coriander and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-668d1c01c2d484eb98289ec7-fd8af8ee.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mexican smashed bean and veggie quesadillas between plates.\n• Top with tomato salsa. Serve with a dollop of light sour cream. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-668d1c01c2d484eb98289ec7-be5d2c42.jpeg"
    }
  ]
